                                                "sense_id": "0ffdaeb0-3bd1-3fd4-882d-c7de9a647c44",
                                                "text": "Demand continues to increase, and in 2023-24 recorded usage was higher than pre-COVID, with 384,000 passenger journeys in total (of which 247,000 were at the town location). At the other end of the branch, Truro station had usage of 1.19 million, of which 255,000 were recorded as interchange passengers."
